text = "Good day,
hope everything is going along well. I would like to order a globe for my brother Sam. Its his birthday today! He loves landscapes over everything, hes always playing some roleplay games with his friends. I think he could make a great use of this snowglobe in his campaign. Maybe he would also apprechiate a wooden base, yeah that would be great.
Thanks in advance,
Pam"
